





╭─ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Move (NORMAL)                                               Compose (INSERT)                                          │
│  j/↓         move down (newer)                               Enter       send                                        │
│  k/↑         move up (older; loads history at the top)       A-Enter/C-j new line                                    │
│  g           go to the top                                   Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread           │
│  G           go to the newest                                                                                        │
│  h/←         pane to the left                              Files                                                     │
│  l/→         pane to the right                               o           open the message's file (xdg-open)          │
│  Tab         next pane                                       I           show or hide inline images                  │
│  S-Tab       previous pane                                   C-o         attach a file (:attach)                     │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Conversations                                               Commands (COMMAND)                                        │
│  Enter       open conversation / thread of message           :q              quit                                    │
│  1–9         switch workspace                                :open <name>    open a conversation by name (#general, …│
│  C-k/C-t     find a conversation (coming soon)               :help           this help                               │
│  C-b         show or hide the sidebar                        :attach <path>  send a file here; any text after it is …│
│  <           narrower sidebar                                                                                        │
│  >           wider sidebar                                 Press any key to close.                                   │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Modes                                                                                                                 │
│  i           write a message (INSERT)                                                                                │
│  :           command line (COMMAND)                                                                                  │
│  Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread                                                                       │
│  ?           this help                                                                                               │
│  q           quit                                                                                                    │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯







